# .trivyignore - accepted risks for Trivy (fs + image scans)
#
# Policy: an entry is only allowed with (1) the CVE/check ID, (2) a justification,
# (3) an owner and (4) an expiry date. Expired entries must be re-reviewed.
# The gate already ignores vulnerabilities that have NO fix available
# (--ignore-unfixed) because there is nothing we can upgrade to.
#
# Format:
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN   # reason | owner | exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# (currently no accepted risks - the image passes the HIGH/CRITICAL gate without exceptions)
